{"3810890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grit the Dark World", "steam_appid": 3810890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sisters of Fate Resurrected a Corpse. You are their Monster  their weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where shadow reigns and death never rests, the cosmic <strong>Sisters of Fate</strong> have torn you back from the grave to wield you as a living weapon. <strong><i>Grit: The Dark World</i></strong> is a <strong>top-down RPG wave shooter</strong> where you must fight through relentless 30-minute gauntlets filled with grotesque horrors, ending in brutal boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kill feeds your power. Every choice changes your fate. Every level pushes you deeper into darkness—and closer to becoming The Monster The Sisters Need</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/5bc7c90ab658c4679387b2ccb411426e.poster.avif?t=1783366971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/5bc7c90ab658c4679387b2ccb411426e.webm?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/5bc7c90ab658c4679387b2ccb411426e.mp4?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>TOP-DOWN WAVE-SHOOTER MAYHEM</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Hordes</strong>: Face procedurally generated swarms of nightmarish enemies in tactical, high-speed combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30-Minute Gauntlets</strong>: Each stage is a timed onslaught, culminating in a unique <strong>boss battle</strong> forged by the Sisters’ dark magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chained Spell Attacks</strong>: Combine elemental powers and weapon abilities into devastating chained combos. Adapt and experiment mid-wave.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/9b1b533f1637945c5ccffc6012aeba45.poster.avif?t=1783366971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/9b1b533f1637945c5ccffc6012aeba45.webm?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/9b1b533f1637945c5ccffc6012aeba45.mp4?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>🕱 RPG ELEMENTS</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points to upgrade your <strong>Health, Stamina, Movement, Damage</strong>, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >becoming faster, stronger, and deadlier with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Up Slot System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Earn and unlock <strong>20+ permanent progression items</strong> that reshape every playthrough </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Abilities:</strong> Discover devastating powers to wield against the Enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack and Swap:</strong> Slot multiple abilities, experiment with builds, and adjust strategies mid-run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Arsenal:</strong> Combine permanent upgrades with temporary power-ups for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Waves:</strong> Confront the Sisters’ resurrected horrors at the climax of each gauntlet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/6d66ee7f13e3d3504a9849934395b2ec.poster.avif?t=1783366971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/6d66ee7f13e3d3504a9849934395b2ec.webm?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/6d66ee7f13e3d3504a9849934395b2ec.mp4?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔥 <strong>Dynamic Wave System</strong> – Procedural enemies and modifiers keep every wave fresh and deadly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧪 <strong>Upgrades</strong> – Each wave is a fresh gamble. Power up wisely—or perish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Precision Combat</strong> – Fast, fluid top-down shooting with chained spell mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📈 <strong>Persistent Stats &amp; Meta Progression</strong> – Build your character with over 20 unlockable items and permanent upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 <strong>Chained Abilities</strong> – Link spells and attacks for advanced synergies and unique effects.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Sisters of Fate Resurrected a Corpse. You are their Monster  their weapon</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where shadow reigns and death never rests, the cosmic <strong>Sisters of Fate</strong> have torn you back from the grave to wield you as a living weapon. <stron