5c5ccffc6012aeba45.poster.avif?t=1783366971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/9b1b533f1637945c5ccffc6012aeba45.webm?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/9b1b533f1637945c5ccffc6012aeba45.mp4?t=1783366971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>🕱 RPG ELEMENTS</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn points to upgrade your <strong>Health, Stamina, Movement, Damage</strong>, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >becoming faster, stronger, and deadlier with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-Up Slot System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression:</strong> Earn and unlock <strong>20+ permanent progression items</strong> that reshape every playthrough </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock Abilities:</strong> Discover devastating powers to wield against the Enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stack and Swap:</strong> Slot multiple abilities, experiment with builds, and adjust strategies mid-run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Arsenal:</strong> Combine permanent upgrades with temporary power-ups for endless replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Waves:</strong> Confront the Sisters’ resurrected horrors at the climax of each gauntlet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/6d66ee7f13e3d3504a9849934395b2ec.poster.avif?t=1783366971\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810890/extras/6d66ee7f13e3d3504a9849934395b2ec.w